  ==> Run  Command 'lvm' as root user
   
              -           lvm
                          |||
              -           pvs                                                   (check physical volume list)
                          |||
              - pvcreate /dev/nvme1n1 /dev/nvme2n1 /dev/nvme3n1
                pvcreate /dev/xvdf /dev/xvdg /dev/xvdh                          ( For Crating Physical volme)
                          |||
                          pvs                                                   (List Physical Volume)

                                                                                  Note: 03 phsical volumes were created after this) 
                          |||
              - vgcreate sachin_volumegroup /dev/nvme1n1 /dev/nvme2n1           ( Volume Group Created with 02 physical volume
                                                                                   /dev/nvme1n1 /dev/nvme2n1) 
                          |||
 
                          vgs                                                   (List all Volume Group)

                          |||

              - lvcreate -L 10G -n sachin_lv sachin_volumegroup                ( Logical volume created)


